<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1983</h1><p class="ref-lede">1983 in world history: 7 events, 1 birth, 13 deaths, 1 state founded and 1 that came to an end. 198 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
